{"unit_id":"xingyingyuzhui__dsh-session-actions#readme-1","repo":"xingyingyuzhui/dsh-session-actions","commit":"e8542a78fb65216597142b04750c6257a2619c25","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-actions README · dsh-session-actions · 会话菜单增强：DeepSeek Harness Web 插件：在会话行「⋯」菜单末尾加上复制 ID、置顶、导出 Markdown、永久删除。侧栏所有工作区上方可以出现「置顶」分组。不改官方组件。\n\nEnglish UI follows the DSH locale.\n\n菜单在官方「重命名 / 分叉 / 归档」下面追加：\n\n| 项 | 作用 |\n|---|---|\n| 复制会话 ID | 把 `session-…` 写进剪贴板 |\n| 置顶会话 | 钉到侧栏最上方的「置顶」分组；原工作区里仍保留 |\n| 导出 Markdown | 导出结构化记录（思考、工具调用、用户/助手正文） |\n| 删除会话 | 确认后**永久删除**该会话目录（不是归档；归档仍用官方菜单） |\n\n置顶分组：默认可折叠（图钉 / 悬停实心三角），行上显示相对时间，悬停出 ⋯。置顶行可在组内拖动排序。置顶名单落在 `~/.dsh/dsh-session-actions/pins.json`。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-session-actions · 会话菜单增强"}
{"unit_id":"xingyingyuzhui__dsh-session-actions#readme-2","repo":"xingyingyuzhui/dsh-session-actions","commit":"e8542a78fb65216597142b04750c6257a2619c25","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-actions README · 安装：前置：本机已能运行 `dsh web`。\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:xingyingyuzhui/dsh-session-actions\n```\n\n装完重启 `dsh web`。\n\n本地开发：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add link:/abs/path/to/dsh-session-actions\n```","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"xingyingyuzhui__dsh-session-actions#readme-3","repo":"xingyingyuzhui/dsh-session-actions","commit":"e8542a78fb65216597142b04750c6257a2619c25","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-actions README · 卸载：```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-session-actions\n```","source":"extracted","section":"卸载"}
